{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":8,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 8:1"},"Doth not wisdom cry? and understanding put forth her voice? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 8:2"},"She standeth in the top of high places, by the way in the places of the paths. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 8:3"},"She crieth at the gates, at the entry of the city, at the coming in at the doors. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 8:4"},"Unto you, O men, I call; and my voice ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," to the sons of man. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 8:5"},"O ye simple, understand wisdom: and, ye fools, be ye of an understanding heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 8:6"},"Hear; for I will speak of excellent things; and the opening of my lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," right things. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 8:7"},"For my mouth shall speak truth; and wickedness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," an abomination to my lips. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 8:8"},"All the words of my mouth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," in righteousness; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is "]},"nothing froward or perverse in them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 8:9"},"They ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," all plain to him that understandeth, and right to them that find knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 8:10"},"Receive my instruction, and not silver; and knowledge rather than choice gold. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 8:11"},"For wisdom ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," better than rubies; and all the things that may be desired are not to be compared to it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 8:12"},"I wisdom dwell with prudence, and find out knowledge of witty inventions. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 8:13"},"The fear of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," to hate evil: pride, and arrogancy, and the evil way, and the froward mouth, do I hate. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 8:14"},"Counsel ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," mine, and sound wisdom: I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["am"]}," understanding; I have strength. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 8:15"},"By me kings reign, and princes decree justice. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 8:16"},"By me princes rule, and nobles, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," all the judges of the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 8:17"},"I love them that love me; and those that seek me early shall find me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 8:18"},"Riches and honour ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," with me; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["yea,"]}," durable riches and righteousness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 8:19"},"My fruit ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," better than gold, yea, than fine gold; and my revenue than choice silver. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 8:20"},"I lead in the way of righteousness, in the midst of the paths of judgment: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 8:21"},"That I may cause those that love me to inherit substance; and I will fill their treasures. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 8:22"},"The LORD possessed me in the beginning of his way, before his works of old. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 8:23"},"I was set up from everlasting, from the beginning, or ever the earth was. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 8:24"},"When ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there were"]}," no depths, I was brought forth; when ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there were"]}," no fountains abounding with water. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 8:25"},"Before the mountains were settled, before the hills was I brought forth: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 8:26"},"While as yet he had not made the earth, nor the fields, nor the highest part of the dust of the world. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 8:27"},"When he prepared the heavens, I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," there: when he set a compass upon the face of the depth: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 8:28"},"When he established the clouds above: when he strengthened the fountains of the deep: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 8:29"},"When he gave to the sea his decree, that the waters should not pass his commandment: when he appointed the foundations of the earth: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 8:30"},"Then I was by him, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," one brought up ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with him: "]},"and I was daily ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," delight, rejoicing always before him; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 8:31"},"Rejoicing in the habitable part of his earth; and my delights ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["were"]}," with the sons of men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PRO 8:32"},"Now therefore hearken unto me, O ye children: for blessed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are they that"]}," keep my ways. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:32"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PRO 8:33"},"Hear instruction, and be wise, and refuse it not. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:33"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"34","sid":"PRO 8:34"},"Blessed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the man that heareth me, watching daily at my gates, waiting at the posts of my doors. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:34"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"35","sid":"PRO 8:35"},"For whoso findeth me findeth life, and shall obtain favour of the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:35"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"36","sid":"PRO 8:36"},"But he that sinneth against me wrongeth his own soul: all they that hate me love death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 8:36"}]}]}
